Monocell console fonts
======================

Lat15-3270.psf.gz
    IBM 3270 terminal font, 9x16, 512 glyphs. Generated from
    3270-Regular.ttf of the 3270font project
    (https://github.com/rbanffy/3270font) with otf2bdf and bdf2psf.
    License: BSD-3-Clause (see BSD-3270.txt).

Lat15-VGA16.psf.gz
    IBM VGA BIOS font, 8x16.

Lat15-Terminus16.psf.gz
    Terminus, 8x16. License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
    (see OFL-Terminus.txt).

Lat15-Fixed16.psf.gz
    X11 Fixed, 8x16.

The VGA, Terminus and Fixed files are copies from the Debian
console-setup package; their copyright and license information is in
/usr/share/doc/console-setup/copyright (copyright.fonts on Debian).

Add your own PSF/PSF.GZ files to ~/.local/share/monocell/fonts and they
appear in Settings -> Appearance -> Theme -> Font.
